[ti:UNDERWATER]
[re:Original project Chinese; line timing only]
[00:22.773]I’d never sing goodbye words for you
[00:29.403]I wanna see innocence, so true.
[00:35.043]On the city lights we were dancing
[00:38.643]I’m okay, don’t need your care
[00:41.663]I wish to be like you, how happy we’d be
[00:44.933]Someone tell me why is my heart crying?
